---
title: "agy acp channel session: one terminal post per person input"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Restart
    lg1: Process
    lg2: Turn
    lg3: Session
    lg4: Breaks AtMostOnePost or NoDuplicateExecution or NoForeignResponse or NoPromptToClearedSession in some cases
    lg5: Path to the AtMostOnePost or NoDuplicateExecution or NoForeignResponse or NoPromptToClearedSession bug
  }
  class lg0 pink
  class lg1 tan
  class lg2 blue
  class lg3 teal
  class lg4 mayBreak
  class lg5 bugPath
  s0: No agy child
  s1: Child up, no session
  s2: Session idle
  s3: Prompt open
  s4: AgentDesk restarting
  s5: Turn answered, post pending
  s6: Session loading (replay)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s0: a person sends a message or writer posts the turn's one terminal message (covers steered inputs)
  s0 --> s1: AgentDesk starts agy acp
  s1 --> s2: session/new or agy refuses the stored id#59; session/new
  s2 --> s2: person runs /clear
  s2 --> s3: session/prompt for the next input (new turn, or steer while a prompt is open)
  s3 --> s4: AgentDesk restarts
  s4 --> s0: boot settles orphaned prompts
  s3 --> s0: agy exits#59; stdout EOF fails open prompts or deadline passes#59; process group killed
  s1 --> s5: agy refuses the stored id#59; session/new
  s5 --> s3: session/prompt for the next input (new turn, or steer while a prompt is open)
  s1 --> s6: reattach the stored id (resume, or load)
  s6 --> s6: load replays an old answer
  s3 --> s5: late response from the killed child
  classDef mayBreak fill:#fff3e6,stroke:#e8730c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#b85a06
  class s0 tan
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 teal
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 teal
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 blue
  class s3 mayBreak
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 pink
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 teal
  class s5 mayBreak
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 teal
  class s6 mayBreak
  class s6 bugPath
